        requirements = nil,
        walkthrough = '1. Speak to any San d\'Orian Gate Guard to begin this Mission.\n   - Ambrotien - Southern San d\'Oria (K-10)\n   - Endracion - Southern San d\'Oria (F-9)\n   - Grilau - Northern San d\'Oria (D-8)\n2. Go outside the city and kill Orcish Fodder until you receive an Orcish Axe.\n   - Orcish Fodder can be found in East Ronfaure and West Ronfaure.\n3. After you receive an Orcish Axe return to the Gate Guard and trade them the Orcish Axe to finish the Mission.',
