        walkthrough = 'If you wish to complete this Mission, trade enough Crystals to a Conquest Overseer to raise your Rank bar and unlock it.\n1. Talk to any Gate Guard and accept the Mission.\n   - There are two in Southern San d\'Oria, Ambrotien at (K-6) and Endracion at (F-9). There is also a gate guard in Northern San d\'Oria, Grilau at (D-8).\n   - A map of Davoi can be purchased for 3000 Gil from Elesca at (I-8) of North San d\'Oria or Violitte at (G-10) of Southern San d\'Oria, but it is not required.\n2. Make your way to Davoi. To reach Davoi, zone into Jugner Forest from La Theine Plateau at (M-8).  Then follow the right wall of Jugner Forest to the zone into Davoi at (G-12).\n3. Talk to the NPC Zantaviat just inside the zone.\n4. Walk south until you reach a pond at (J-8). On the South bank of the pond you will find a ! targetable location.  Click on it to receive the [Key Item] Lost document.\n5. Return to Zantaviat to recieve the [Key Item] Temple Knights\' Davoi report.\n6. Return to a Gate Guard.\n7. Examine the Door: Papal Chambers, which is on the top floor of the Cathedral in Northern San d\'Oria.\n8. After the cutscene, the Mission will be completed.',
